OL,3,GNEWSAStage suit worn by Max Miller
OL,4,Agoing to museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stage suit worn by music hall
OL,7,Fcomedian Max Miller will be given to a
OL,8,Fmuseum in Brighton to help celebrate
OL,9,Fhis links to his home city.
OL,11,FVic Chapman, secretary of the Max
OL,12,FMiller Appreciation Society, says the
OL,13,Fgroup will give a suit it has held for
OL,14,Fmore than 15 years to the Brighton
OL,15,FMuseum on Tuesday, in the hope that it
OL,16,Fcan be put on display.
OL,18,FThe suit has been reviewed as genuine
OL,19,Fafter it was given to the group by a
OL,20,Fwoman in Steyning who was given it by
OL,21,FMiller, Chapman says.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
